 180:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the HASH peripheral according to the specified parameters
 181:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *         in the HASH_InitStruct structure.
 182:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   * @note   the hash processor is reset when calling this function so that the
 183:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *         HASH will be ready to compute the message digest of a new message.
 184:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *         There is no need to call HASH_Reset() function.           
 185:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   * @param  HASH_InitStruct: pointer to a HASH_InitTypeDef structure that contains
 186:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *         the configuration information for the HASH peripheral.
 187:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   * @note   The field HASH_HMACKeyType in HASH_InitTypeDef must be filled only 
 188:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *          if the algorithm mode is HMAC.       
