 258:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c **** /** @defgroup HASH_Group2 Message Digest generation functions
 259:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****  *  @brief    Message Digest generation functions
 260:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****  *
 261:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c **** @verbatim    
 262:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****  ===============================================================================
 263:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****                   ##### Message Digest generation functions #####
 264:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 265:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****  [..] This section provides functions allowing the generation of message digest: 
 266:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****    (+) Push data in the IN FIFO : using HASH_DataIn()
 267:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****    (+) Get the number of words set in IN FIFO, use HASH_GetInFIFOWordsNbr()  
 268:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****    (+) set the last word valid bits number using HASH_SetLastWordValidBitsNbr() 
 269:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****    (+) start digest calculation : using HASH_StartDigest()
 270:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****    (+) Get the Digest message : using HASH_GetDigest()
 271:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****  
 272:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c **** @endverbatim
 273:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   * @{
 274:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   */
