 280:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *           This parameter must be a number between 0 and 0x1F.
 281:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *             - 0x00: All 32 bits of the last data written are valid
 282:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *             - 0x01: Only bit [0] of the last data written is valid
 283:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *             - 0x02: Only bits[1:0] of the last data written are valid
 284:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *             - 0x03: Only bits[2:0] of the last data written are valid
 285:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *             - ...
 286:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *             - 0x1F: Only bits[30:0] of the last data written are valid    
 287:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   * @note   The Number of valid bits must be set before to start the message 
 288:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   *         digest competition (in Hash and HMAC) and key treatment(in HMAC).    
 289:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   * @retval None
 290:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_hash.c ****   */
